cope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004:m0231","surface":"殷公愍","start":231,"end":234,"person_id":"4be_inu_qlw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004:m0239","surface":"公愍","start":239,"end":241,"person_id":"4be_inu_qlw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004","text":"初，子懋鎮雍，世祖勑以邊略曰：「吾比連得諸處啓，所說不異，虜必無敢送死理，然爲其備，不可蹔懈。今秋犬羊輩越逸者，其亡滅之徵。吾今亦行密纂集，須有分明指的，便當有大處分。今普勑鎮守，竝部偶民丁，有事卽便應接運，已勑更遣，想行有至者，汝共諸人量覔，可使人數往南陽舞陰諸要處參覘。糧食最爲根本，更不憂人仗，常行視驛亭馬，不可有廢闕。并約語諸州，當其堺皆爾，不如法，卽問事。」又曰：「吾勑荊、郢二鎮，各作五千人陣，本擬應接彼耳。賊若送死者，更卽呼取之。已勑子真，魚繼宗、殷公愍至鎮，可以公愍爲城主，三千人配之便足。汝可好以階級在意，勿得人求，或超五三階。及文章詩筆，乃是佳事，然世務彌爲根本，可常憶之。汝所啓仗，此悉是吾左右御仗也，云何得用之。品格不可乖，吾自當優量覔送。」先是啓求所好書，上又曰：「知汝常以書讀在心，足爲深欣也。」賜子懋杜預手所定《左傳》及《古今善言》。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zimao:p004:m0002","surface":"子懋","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"ltu_nhs_gk6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳